title: Executive
subtitle: The Zentrale: the party's leadership between congresses.
is-pinned-card: true
tags: rf_top
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var RF = window.RF;
Q.exec_ready = Q.exec_month == Q.time ? 0 : 1;
Q.next_congress = RF.nextCongressText(Q);
var t = Q.year * 12 + Q.month;
Q.congress_soon = Q.congress_number > 8 && Q.congress_due - t <= 3 ? 1 : 0;
Q.congress_far = Q.congress_number > 8 && Q.congress_due - t > 3 ? 1 : 0;
!}

= The Zentrale

The Zentrale runs the party between congresses: the press, the districts, the money and the line. Between congresses the Zentralausschuss, the Zentrale together with the district leaders, is the party's highest body. The Executive can take one decision a month.

Next party congress: [+ next_congress +]

- @za
- @postpone
- @early
- @delegation
- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@za
title: Convene the Zentralausschuss.
subtitle: The district leaders air their grievances. Calms every faction a little; the leadership's faction gains.
choose-if: exec_ready = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Executive has already acted this month.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 3; }
Q[Q.leader + '_strength'] += 1;
Q.exec_month = Q.time;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

= The Zentralausschuss

For two days the district leaders argue with the Zentrale over the line, the money and the paper. Nothing much is decided, but everyone has been heard.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@postpone
title: Put off the next congress.
subtitle: Four more months before the delegates meet. The other factions are angered, and Moscow dislikes it.
view-if: congress_soon = 1 and congress_postponed = 0
choose-if: exec_ready = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Executive has already acted this month.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.congress_due += 4;
Q.congress_postponed = 1;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { if (f != Q.leader) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 5; } }
Q[Q.leader + '_moscow'] -= 3;
Q.exec_month = Q.time;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

= The Congress Is Put Off

The Zentrale cites the situation, the cost and the danger of police raids. The opposition says the leadership is afraid of the delegates.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@early
title: Call the congress early.
subtitle: The delegates meet next month. The leadership gets less time to prepare; the opposition is pleased.
view-if: congress_far = 1
choose-if: exec_ready = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Executive has already acted this month.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.congress_due = Q.year * 12 + Q.month + 1;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { if (f != Q.leader) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 4; } }
Q.exec_month = Q.time;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

= An Early Congress

The Zentrale calls the delegates together next month. The districts begin electing them at once.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@delegation
title: Send a delegation to Moscow.
subtitle: The leadership explains itself to the International. More standing in Moscow for the leadership, less autonomy for the party.
choose-if: exec_ready = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Executive has already acted this month.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.leader + '_moscow'] += 5;
Q.autonomy -= 3;
Q.exec_month = Q.time;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

= A Delegation to Moscow

The delegates spend a fortnight in the Hotel Lux and the corridors of the International. They come back with praise, advice and a list of things Moscow expects.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.
